OL,3,GNEWSANew containers to be rolled out in
OL,4,Arecycling drive
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew recycling containers are to be
OL,7,Frolled out in Bristol - with the first
OL,8,Fbatch delivered to residents on Monday.
OL,10,FA new red bag for plastics and cans,
OL,11,Fwhich is 60% bigger than the old green
OL,12,Fbox, will be given to households along
OL,13,Fwith a blue bag for card and paper.
OL,15,FThe swap will happen on the usual bin
OL,16,Fdays for each area and be done by
OL,17,Fcrews. City bosses hope the move will
OL,18,Fboost recycling rates by a further 2%.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
