OL,3,GNEWSANew containers to be rolled out in
OL,4,Arecycling drive
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Abi Finch, chair of Bristol
OL,7,FCity Council's environment and
OL,8,Fsustainability committee, said the old
OL,9,Fboxes used to lead to recycling blowing
OL,10,Facross streets. "These new containers
OL,11,Fhave been carefully chosen to resolve
OL,12,Fthese issues after listening to
OL,13,Fpeople's concerns."
